[00:25.24] The door is ajar
[00:30.08] I stand in the hall
[00:38.20] Watching the shadow
[00:42.56] You cast on the wall
[00:49.28] You haven't spoken since Tuesday began
[00:55.22] You're barely a ghost, let alone a man
[01:01.58] The dinner I made is cold on the plate
[01:07.82] Solidified grease, resigning to fate
[01:14.14] You whisper to servers across the abyss
[01:20.54] Ignoring the warmth of a physical kiss
[01:27.18] There is no castle
[01:30.36] There is no queen
[01:33.08] Just a lonely man
[01:35.60] And a blue-lit screen
[01:38.60] You're conducting an orchestra
[01:42.51] No one can hear
[01:45.56] While the real world dissolves and disappears
[01:51.19] You think you are building a kingdom of code?
[01:57.58] You're just wasting away in this humble abode
[02:12.80] I look at your eyes
[02:17.30] Reflecting the glow
[02:25.28] Of data and streams
[02:29.98] That endlessly flow
[02:36.28] You smile at the monitor, a lover's embrace
[02:41.82] But the pixels don't care about your unshaven face
[02:48.88] The "Beast" that you fear? It isn't the Baud
[02:54.56] It's the silence behind you, ignoring your god
[03:01.54] The "Beauty" you seek in the render's design?
[03:07.82] She doesn't have a heart
[03:13.36] But I broke mine
[03:20.42] Unplug the machine!
[03:24.00] Look at me now!
[03:27.14] Take off the headset
[03:29.54] Wipe the sweat from your brow!
[03:32.32] But you don't turn around
[03:36.22] You don't even blink
[03:39.22] You're drowning in data
[03:45.58] And I watch you sink
[04:11.36] There is no castle
[04:14.54] There is no queen
[04:17.32] Just a lonely man
[04:19.80] And a blue-lit screen
[04:22.82] You're conducting an orchestra
[04:26.53] No one can hear
[04:29.76] While the real world dissolves and disappears
[04:36.14] You think you are building a kingdom of code?
[04:41.76] You're just wasting away in this humble abode
[04:49.24] Witness the void
[04:52.36] Witness the screen
[04:55.58] Witness the nothing
[05:02.38] In between
